 a localized Landau spotlight turn one-sided windows into zero-free half-planes."},{"id":"dest","label":"Destination","summary":"Conductor descent and functional-equation reflection turn Re s > 1/2 into the five exported theorems."}],"components":[{"n":13,"id":"galois","stratum":"arith","col":0,"row":0,"title":"The Galois row","lean":"UpperTheory.Gal.Int.galoisLocalGlobalStrong_recParameter","url":"https://github.com/Deicyde/riemann-hypothesis/blob/40e56bab026552e089d7afcfeff08d2defb9c005/src/Development/AutomorphicArithmetic/Foundations/GaloisRepresentations/IntegralStructures/RowSrc.lean#L6-L6","gist":"Attaches continuous semisimple \u2113-adic Galois representations matching Satake parameters to regular algebraic polarized cuspidal representations on GL_a over CM fields."},{"n":12,"id":"primes","stratum":"arith","col":1,"row":0,"title":"Auxiliary primes & Behrend towers","lean":"QH.pairEx \u00b7 hostThickExists","url":"https://github.com/Deicyde/riemann-hypothesis/blob/40e56bab026552e089d7afcfeff08d2defb9c005/src/Development/AutomorphicArithmetic/MeanSquareBounds/pairEx.lean#L112-L169","gist":"Selects primes q \u2261 3 (mod 8) and d \u2261 7 (mod 16) giving \u221ay bounds on quadratic twists, plus a Behrend digit sphere choosing a tower free of short affine relations."},{"n":4,"id":"statistic","stratum":"ana","col":2,"row":0,"title":"Centered prime sum","lean":"Formalism.Gz \u00b7 Level.Gm","url":"https://github.com/Deicyde/riemann-hypothesis/blob/40e56bab026552e089d7afcfeff08d2defb9c005/src/Formalism/StatementOC.lean#L13-L13","gist":"Defines G(y) = \u03a3 \u039b(n)(y/n \u2212 1) \u2212 y log y + (1+\u03b3)y and positive averages G_P(y) over cyclic families of Dirichlet characters."},{"n":14,"id":"inputs","stratum":"arith","col":0,"row":1,"title":"Seven decisive inputs","lean":"UpperTheory.Lit.every_character_of_theta_integrals_local_matching","url":"https://github.com/Deicyde/riemann-hypothesis/blob/40e56bab026552e089d7afcfeff08d2defb9c005/src/Development/AutomorphicArithmetic/ThetaCorrespondence/ThetaPairLifts/ThirdPlaceSeries/SiegelEisensteinSecondTermHypotheses.lean#L69-L73","gist":"Assembles unitary-group eigenvalues, local theta lifts, theta-integral agreement, local matching, covolume bounds, local Langlands parameters, and the cohomology window."},{"n":11,"id":"cohomology","stratum":"arith","col":1,"row":1,"title":"Cohomological window","lean":"UpperTheory.Top.VWinAt \u00b7 window1","url":"https://github.com/Deicyde/riemann-hypothesis/blob/40e56bab026552e089d7afcfeff08d2defb9c005/src/Development/AutomorphicArithmetic/CharacterBoxes/ExistsPageN.lean#L44-L47","gist":"Bounds locally trivial H^1 lengths up to twist x^401 by \u221aexp(x^\u03b5) across a whole interval [Y, Y^2] by dodging finitely many exceptional twists."},{"n":5,"id":"residues","stratum":"ana","col":2,"row":1,"title":"Mellin & positive residues","lean":"MellinRamp \u00b7 Deduction.poleData","url":"https://github.com/Deicyde/riemann-hypothesis/blob/40e56bab026552e089d7afcfeff08d2defb9c005/src/Development/AutomorphicArithmetic/DedekindLFunctions/LandauTheorems/MellinRamp.lean#L10-L32","gist":"Transforms the ramp (y/n \u2212 1)_+ into n^{-s}/(s(s\u22121)); positive family weights ensure zeros of different characters cannot cancel."},{"n":9,"id":"family","stratum":"est","col":0,"row":2,"title":"Theta-lift chain (~\u221ax)","lean":"UpperTheory.Top.topDesWin \u00b7 RankVal","url":"https://github.com/Deicyde/riemann-hypothesis/blob/40e56bab026552e089d7afcfeff08d2defb9c005/src/Development/AutomorphicArithmetic/CharacterBoxes/DesWin.lean#L11-L31","gist":"Builds a chain of m \u2248 x^(1/2 \u2212 \u03b5/16) theta lifts with divisibility, minor congruences, and Bost slope bounds, fixing loss exponents e_D = 2, e_L = 0 before \u03b5 is chosen."},{"n":10,"id":"hosts","stratum":"est","col":1,"row":2,"title":"Hosts per character","lean":"UpperTheory.Top.supplyChi","url":"https://github.com/Deicyde/riemann-hypothesis/blob/40e56bab026552e089d7afcfeff08d2defb9c005/src/Development/AutomorphicArithmetic/CharacterBoxes/SupplyChi.lean#L8-L16","gist":"Converts VWinAt \u03c8 401 into arithmetic hosts covering windows of width [Y, Y^(3/2)] for each primitive character \u03c8."},{"n":6,"id":"criterion","stratum":"ana","col":2,"row":2,"title":"Window criterion","lean":"Deduction.zeroFree_of_rpow_window","url":"https://github.com/Deicyde/riemann-hypothesis/blob/40e56bab026552e089d7afcfeff08d2defb9c005/src/Development/AutomorphicArithmetic/DedekindLFunctions/LandauTheorems/ZeroFreeOfRpowWindow.lean#L11-L14","gist":"High Laplace derivatives focus like a Gamma spotlight on [Y, Y^(3/2)], turning a one-sided bound G_P(y) \u2264 C y^\u03b8 into nonvanishing for Re s > \u03b8."},{"n":8,"id":"comparison","stratum":"est","col":0.5,"row":3,"title":"Finite character comparison","lean":"UpperTheory.Comparison\u2082.core_gm","url":"https://github.com/Deicyde/riemann-hypothesis/blob/40e56bab026552e089d7afcfeff08d2defb9c005/src/Development/AutomorphicArithmetic/PrimitiveCosets/CoreGm.lean#L12-L74","gist":"Finite Fourier orthogonality cancels main terms identically and balances x/m against m at m \u2248 \u221ax, giving G_P(x) \u2264 x^(1/2 + 9\u03b5)."},{"n":7,"id":"choreography","stratum":"ana","col":1.5,"row":3,"title":"Order of choices","lean":"Formalism.HC.level_of_tiedWin","url":"https://github.com/Deicyde/riemann-hypothesis/blob/40e56bab026552e089d7afcfeff08d2defb9c005/src/Formalism/SharpRestriction/RamificationFrobenius/TotientGaloisClasses/TopWin.lean#L68-L81","gist":"Given any hypothetical zero at Re s = \u03b2 > 1/2, picks \u03b8 halfway to \u03b2 and shrinks \u03b5 \u2264 (\u03b8 \u2212 1/2)/9. No bound at \u03b5 = 0 is ever needed."},{"n":3,"id":"descent","stratum":"dest","col":0,"row":4,"title":"Conductor descent","lean":"UpperTheory.Top.imprimitive","url":"https://github.com/Deicyde/riemann-hypothesis/blob/40e56bab026552e089d7afcfeff08d2defb9c005/src/Development/AutomorphicArithmetic/CharacterBoxes/Imprimitive.lean#L5-L35","gist":"Extends Re s 